@localhost = http://localhost:3000
@render = https://cse341-library-api-b2pm.onrender.com

# POST, PUT and DELETE requests and GET /profile need a login. They send
# the appSession cookie that the server sets when you log in:
# 1. In a browser, log in at http://localhost:3000/login (for localCookie)
#    or https://cse341-library-api-b2pm.onrender.com/login (for renderCookie).
# 2. Open the browser's developer tools, go to Application > Cookies,
#    pick the site and copy the Value of the appSession cookie.
# 3. Paste it right after "appSession=" below.
# A copied cookie works for about a day after you copy it (logging out in
# the browser doesn't stop it). When those requests start getting 401
# responses, copy a new one.
@localCookie = appSession=
@renderCookie = appSession=

# "# @no-cookie-jar" stops REST Client from saving cookies from responses
# and sending them with later requests. Each request then sends only the
# Cookie header written in it, so the "without logging in" requests
# always get a 401.
#
# The Render section has the same requests as the localhost section.
#
# Send the requests in order: "Get a book by id" uses the first id from
# "Get all books", and the GET, PUT and DELETE requests after
# "Create a book" use the id that it returns. The author requests
# work the same way.
#
# Render's free plan sleeps when it isn't used, so the first Render
# request can take up to a minute.

########## Localhost ##########

### Home route
GET {{localhost}}/

### API documentation (Swagger UI). Open this url in a browser to try each route.
